WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Why did you increase your strength?

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,280
Dog system, are you sick?

3
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,920
Then why do you call it the Da Mou Room System?

4
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,320
Mr. Li, you are back

5
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,320
I wish I could come back safely

6
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,520
Your Highness, the three hundred warriors are back.

7
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:10,160
Moujia brought you a lot of money back.

8
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,040
They must have been lured around outside Hulukou.

9
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,720
I retreated knowing that I couldn't do anything.

10
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,160
Being able to save the troops and horses is considered prudent.

11
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,200
Brother Li, I hope you come back safely.

12
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,120
gentlemen

13
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,400
This time the family’s plan

14
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,360
It worked

15
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,840
When planning a family, we talk about planning a family.

16
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:22,800
It's definitely doable

17
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:27,120
Mr. Li, what did you just say?

18
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,920
You, you said your plan worked

19
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,640
Didn’t I hear this correctly?

20
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,760
Yes, Your Highness

21
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,200
The family plans a plan with three hundred warriors

22
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,000
They burned down Qi Jun’s granary at Hulukou.

23
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,220
The Qi army suddenly retreated

24
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:39,500
It was really him who did it

25
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,260
He actually burned down the heavily guarded granary.

26
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,060
Mr. Li, you are from Qi Army’s food and grass department.

27
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,380
There are tens of thousands of Qi troops in Hulukou.

28
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,820
I can't say that

29
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:46,780
It's me who leads the charge

30
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:48,460
He must have killed through an enemy camp of tens of thousands of people.

31
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,620
I am an elegant counselor

32
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:50,540
Did my husband's thing

33
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:52,440
How shameless

34
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,920
Zhang Baihu, tell me

35
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,440
Your Highness, you didn’t know that we arrived at Hulukou

36
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:57,960
Mr. Li took us directly to the battle

37
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,600
Mr. Li is simply a god descending to earth.

38
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,000
He entered and exited a camp of tens of thousands of people alone

39
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:01,960
Entering the land of no one

40
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:03,440
Mr. Li even shot him

41
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:05,880
Rumor has it that the most powerful general in Qi was beaten to death alive.

42
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,120
Later, Qi Jun chased him out

43
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,400
Mr. Li cuts off his wife alone

44
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,120
A spear is like crossing a dragon into the sea

45
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:12,080
The Qi army was so brave that they killed the rat skewers with their heads in their arms.

46
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:13,600
I will wait until I return safely
